# Public Turing demo backing the hero live search + chat (T478/T620).
#
# Leave VITE_TURING_DEMO_URL unset to keep the in-page demos on the bundled sample
# data. Set it (at build time) to run REAL semantic search + grounded chat against a
# public demo instance (viglet/cloud → docker compose --profile demo; see docker/DEMO.md):
#
# VITE_TURING_DEMO_URL=https://turing-demo.viglet.org
#
# The SN site name is OPTIONAL: when VITE_TURING_DEMO_SITE is set it is used verbatim;
# when it is left unset the site is auto-discovered at runtime from the instance's
# public /api/sn/names endpoint (first site), so a re-seeded demo just works without a
# rebuild. Pin it only if the demo hosts more than one site and you want a specific one:
#
# VITE_TURING_DEMO_SITE=mythical-creatures
